              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī shakoolechiwa shenīshi shitī na solobo ū kū bing'we, nguno īlī gītī mihayo yandīkilwe mu shitabo, hama shūkundīkījiwa, shūtungwa n'itungījo. Ūlū winhwa munhū amanile kūsoma ūwīlwa, “Alishisomage īshi!” Akushosha alīhaya, “Natūdūla shitungile itungījo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.29.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.29.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
